tly reports the filtered search (3+ stars, 8+ guest rating, parking) with 438 properties found and provides a concrete matching example (Hotel La Villa Saint Germain Des Prés), which is verifiable in the screenshots.\n\nAll task components — correct site, location, dates, star rating filter, guest rating filter, parking, and reported results — are satisfied.\n\n## Verdict: **SUCCESS**",
